{
  "name": "B2B Company to Domain, LinkedIn, Email & WhatsApp Enricher for Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## B2B Lead Enrichment Pipeline (3-in-1 Pure HTTP)\n\nReads raw company names, domains, or work emails from **Google Sheets**, enriches each lead in one Apify call (**official domain, verified LinkedIn company URL, prioritized role emails, WhatsApp, phones, and 6 social links**), and writes enriched rows back to Google Sheets.\n\n### Setup Steps\n1. Create a Google Sheet with an `Input` tab containing a `company` column (e.g. `Stripe`, `Linear`, `canva.com`) and an `Enriched` tab.\n2. Connect your **Google Sheets** OAuth credential to both Google Sheets nodes and set your spreadsheet document ID.\n3. Create an n8n **Header Auth** credential (`Name`: `Authorization`, `Value`: `Bearer <your_apify_token>`) and select it on **Enrich Companies via Apify**.\n4. Click **Test workflow**!\n\n**Actor URL:** https://apify.com/maitreya_buddha/b2b-company-domain-linkedin-enricher\n**Cost:** $2.50 / 1,000 enriched companies · **$0 for unresolved/parked domains** · 128 MB RAM · $0 proxy.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0003-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
